  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>Beavers are stocky, herbivorous rodents that live in freshwater ecosystems throughout Avistan. They live in lodges, which they construct from logs, grass, rocks, and mud.</p>\n<p>A typical beaver can grow up to 4 feet long and weigh up to 65 pounds.</p>",
